    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "We finally get to leave this stinking place soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Are you alright, 'Spy'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
            "key": "$darkness01_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "...Whoof... *huff*... I'm fine, Mandragora."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "The last few times I've heard the word 'spy' it's been from a Sarkaz thinking up some fresh new punishment. I almost forgot it was my codename."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Then pick a more tasteful one next time, if you have the chance. 'The Elocutionist' and all that lot had good ones, and they kicked the bucket without leaving so much as a smear."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "Haha..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Save your strength for now. The Leader still needs the Sarkaz intel you found."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "You mean... The Shard..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "No, don't say it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Not like I don't want to hear, but... we need the Leader's approval. Our soldiers are all clean sorts. Don't go giving them too big a burden to carry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "I understand... Mandragora... you've always been such a good girl."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Don't sweet-talk me like 'The Bandit' did. Sick of it. They're all gone and now I'm stuck here alone in this shithole having to worry about the Leader."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "At least you got back quick. While you were gone, that Harmonie bastard was glued to the Leader's side day and night, and I was terrified that... that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "Terrified... that what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "That the Leader would get too close to those noble sorts, and that someday, she'd have no more use for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "The Leader, eh... *sigh*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_244",
            "fadetime": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier",
        "text": "Ma'am, I've ascertained the others' positions. They're still in the same place, watching the door for the Sarkaz. Are we linking up with them right now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Mm. Get the paramedics going. 'The Spy' needs immediate treatment."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Right, one more thing. Find a Messenger and notify Count Mourning outside the city immediately. We have to ensure 'The Spy' meets the Leader as soon as possible."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "Count Mourning? You... involved him for the Leader?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "Tch. Times like these, we have no choice but to hope the nobles do something to help. Funny kind of joke, isn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taran Secret Agent",
        "text": "*cough* *cough*... You... You've grown well..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_233_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora",
        "text": "That's not like you, 'Spy'. You're speaking too much rubbish. Save the rest for when you're not ragged enough to drop dead at a stiff breeze."
    },
