        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "Robben, are you still fine for ammo?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Robben",
        "text": "Ha... haha... sorry, Horn. Truth is, I've been hiding an explosive shell on me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Robben",
        "text": "All this time, I've had it in my head that if I fall into the enemy's hands at some point again... I'll be taking this shell with me to my last stand."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "...Shame, we improvised that shell ourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Robben",
        "text": "How's that got anything to do with\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Horn",
        "text": "And I'm very sorry, but I'm not inclined to give you that opportunity."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Robben",
        "text": "Eh? My shell\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
